Validate every F40 archive member with bounded parallel decoding

Use four content-validation workers with at most eight queued members and a 64 MiB queued-byte budget. Preserve complete member hashes, schema, row-count checks, and fail-closed receipt publication. Full-source probe improved 2.43-3.20 seconds to 0.81-0.90 seconds; 59 related tests and the asynchronous row-count failure regression passed.


